Package: ccflowR
Title: Cell-Cell Communication Flow Visualization
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("ccflow", "Authors", email = "ccflow@example.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Visualize cell-cell communication data as interactive Sankey river
    plots. Designed for results from bioinformatics tools like NicheNet and
    MultiNicheNet, which predict ligand-receptor interactions in single-cell
    biology research. Displays communication flow from Sender -> Ligand ->
    Receptor -> Receiver with multiple coloring strategies.
